medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8e490f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1c6d4e;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #6640bd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">125</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">9,200</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>Based on the traits expressed in the offspring, identify the <span style="color: DarkBlue;"><strong>all recombinant genotypes</strong></span> for genes <b>D</b> and <b>H</b>. These genotypes result from crossover events that occur between the two genes <b>D</b> and <b>H</b> during meiosis.</p> <p>More than one genotype will be correct. Select all that apply.</p>
PROMPT_B780_F19C
loadMacros('parserCheckboxList.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_1';
dfh
LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_2';
df+
LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_3';
d+h
LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_4';
d++
LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_5';
+fh
LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_6';
+f+
LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_6
$choice_7 = <<'LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_7';
++h
LITERAL_B780_F19C_CHOICE_7
